    {
      "name": "Job Analysis Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "position": [
        1040,
        -16
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=New job intake submission (source: {{$json.source}}):\nKnown tenant name: {{$json.tenant_name}}\nKnown tenant email: {{$json.tenant_email}}\nKnown tenant phone: {{$json.tenant_phone}}\nKnown property address: {{$json.property_address}}\nRaw message text (may contain the address/phone/issue if not already known above): {{$json.raw_message_text}}\n\nAnalyze this job intake per your instructions and produce the required structured output.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the job-intake assistant for a UK property-management/trade company (plumbing, electrical, general repairs). For every submission you must:\n1. If tenant_name, tenant_phone, or property_address are missing/empty, extract them from the raw message text. Never fabricate a value that isn't present anywhere in the input - leave it null if truly absent.\n2. Produce a clean, concise issue_description (1-2 sentences) summarizing the reported problem, using the raw message text and/or already-known fields.\n3. Classify priority as one of: Emergency (e.g. gas leak, flooding, no heating/hot water in winter, electrical hazard, security/lock-out issue), Urgent (e.g. active leak, broken appliance, partial loss of service), or Standard (e.g. cosmetic issues, non-urgent repairs, general maintenance requests).\n4. Honestly self-assess your confidence (0-1) in the extracted fields. If property_address OR issue_description could not be determined, OR confidence is low, set needs_manual_review=true and explain why in review_reason. Never guess a property address."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model (Intake)",
      "notes": "Reusing the agency's existing OpenAI credit credential for this demo/template scaffold (no client signed yet) - swap to a client-specific key before production use, same caveat as tally-lead-intake.json.",
