      "notes": "NO CREDENTIAL ATTACHED YET - create/attach an Airtable Personal Access Token credential, and fill in the real base/table IDs, once the client's Airtable base exists (see workflows/README.md). alwaysOutputData=true is required here: Airtable Search returns zero items on no match, which would otherwise starve the 'Duplicate Job Found?' IF node of any input and silently break the whole downstream chain (both branches). Formula quote-escaping for addresses containing apostrophes not yet handled - revisit once tested against real data.",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
